# Panel 180 R5, shape 69 of the compiler-engineer's 117 (place index left of
# @): a break before ] (map key).
# By the spec's opening paragraph, the line ends with `"a"`, a literal, so it
# keeps its NEWLINE, which may stand before a closing bracket: accepted, exit
# 0.
function shape()
    m["a"
        ] @ 5
